st.2014"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2025 was CF: $3 billion, 55% of revenue.","cites":["ZBRA.mix.segment.2025.0","ZBRA.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was North America: $2.7 billion, 50% of revenue.","cites":["ZBRA.mix.geography.2025.0","ZBRA.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2025 was Tangible Products: $4.4 billion, 82% of revenue.","cites":["ZBRA.mix.product.2025.0","ZBRA.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the customer it labels “Customer A” at 29% of revenue.","cites":["ZBRA.conc.2025.0"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the customer it labels “Customer A” at 16% of revenue (within CF).","cites":["ZBRA.conc.2025.1"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the customer it labels “Customer B” at 15% of revenue.","cites":["ZBRA.conc.2025.2"]}]}}